  },
  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></math> represent resistance, inductive reactance and capacitive reactance. Then which of the following is dimensionless:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>R</mi><msqrt><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></msqrt></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>R</mi><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mfrac><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>As resistance, inductive reactance and capacitive reactance have same unit&nbsp;ohm. So, all three have same dimension.</p><p>Thus,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>R</mi><msqrt><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></msqrt></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is dimensionless.</p>"
  }
